{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-21","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：可公度量与中项无理线段与无理线段","englishTitle":"The rectangle contained by rational straight lines commensurable in square only is irrational, and the side of the square equal to it is irrational. Let the latter be called medial.","book":10,"number":21,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.21","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.21/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":21,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","contentId":"euclid-10-21","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af0f1d18e78120bbc06ec3384585b75b605abe46deebdc450116206525feb7d9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-21.statement","euclid-10-21.construction.1","euclid-10-21.proof.1","euclid-10-21.proof.2","euclid-10-21.proof.3","euclid-10-21.proof.4","euclid-10-21.proof.5","euclid-10-21.proof.6","euclid-10-21.construction.2","euclid-10-21.proof.7","euclid-10-21.proof.8","euclid-10-21.proof.9","euclid-10-21.conclusion","euclid-10-21.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-21.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cbacdc3ba8148707824b34fc3a5e17581c08e312d3aad6bd257788fb2aa085ff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The rectangle contained by rational straight lines commensurable in square only is irrational, and the side of the square equal to it is irrational. Let the latter be called medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度所组成的矩形是无理,正方形的一侧等于无理；这里涉及中项无理量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"21830525585787e9b75df6a8806244b9cfe4125bb984821d7cceee0a03c6f71b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the rectangle AC be contained by the rational straight lines AB, BC commensurable in square only; I say that AC is irrational, and the side of the square equal to it is irrational; and let the latter be called medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由有理线段 AB、BC 平方可公度而长度不可公度组成矩形 AC;我说AC是无理,正方形的一方等于无理;让后者称为中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25426ceeecce1019204c77357084ab1a8229778a2cb6e0360e9ed32027363e52","citations":["euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For on AB let the square AD be described; therefore AD is rational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,请说明正方形 AD,因此AD是有理。 [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2820927dff4c2e2dd08d9143955626a3dfa0f882482c0aebd956b5739372039f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is incommensurable in length with BC, for by hypothesis they are commensurable in square only, while AB is equal to BD, therefore DB is also incommensurable in length with BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是不可公度,BC是BC,假设是平方可公度而长度不可公度,AB等于BD,DB也是不可公度,BC等于BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7e11ffbbab59f31ba9a0507c45a8552263a5cf9c84be25fa4139c3dd7c44e1bf","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as DB is to BC, so is AD to AC; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore DA is incommensurable with AC. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DB比BC等于AD比AC,因此DA比AC；DB 与 BC 之比等于 AD 与 AC 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0a5475e33359f2141af46df8efe899058f0de3fa0cf4da3d0a66827d242e8b72","citations":["euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DA is rational; therefore AC is irrational, so that the side of the square equal to AC is also irrational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DA是有理,AC是无理,正方形等于AC的一方也是无理。 [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4728ba28c9e9fe93b3cf5878477099660144ed58679b035d3c1d68de9576f0e9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let the latter be called medial. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"后一种叫中项无理线段 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f77093a4bc34a4e5176550c6234d9619d74aa75ce05141949db8f45a74360930","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Lemma. If there be two straight lines, then, as the first is to the second, so is the square on the first to the rectangle contained by the two straight lines."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"引理。 如果有两个直线, 那么第一个直线与第二个直线的比例等于第一个直线的正方形与两个直线组成的矩形的比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98d6ad47227baaea262fdb35beb87e24e21c2f7f1665e71df520493f8cfecebe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let FE, EG be two straight lines."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FE,EG是两条直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3db9b504f05c78918fd06d0d5fe34ed56fc6d5c340ba23d1fe4890c2070ffe8a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that, as FE is to EG, so is the square on FE to the rectangle FE, EG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,FE对EG的比等于FE对正方形对矩形对FE对EG的比"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7064a39abca5494e1005aa596d56a6477fb19ee3e7b861bd7444d649420c2aff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For on FE let the square DF be described, and let GD be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FE,请说明正方形 DF,GD完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be8e4c1d5c24255debf2abd28a9acad2961131afdd07225b61f2b33ac0536989","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, as FE is to EG, so is FD to DG, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] and FD is the square on FE, and DG the rectangle DE, EG, that is, the rectangle FE, EG, therefore, as FE is to EG, so is the square on FE to the rectangle FE, EG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,FE对EG的比等于FD对DG,FD对FE的比是正方形,EG对矩形,DE,EG,即矩形对FE,EG,FE对EG,FE对正方形,EG；FE 与 EG 之比等于 FD 与 DG 之比 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13f51b88079d5936c959a4dcd202fcca3ed53a985e38d1041f7db4826aa8f3f3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly also, as the rectangle GE, EF is to the square on EF, that is, as GD is to FD, so is GE to EF. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,矩形 GE,EF,EF,EF,EF,EF,GD和FD的比等于GE和EF,Q和E；GD 与 FD 之比等于 GE 与 EF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-21.source","contentId":"euclid-10-21","revisionId":"euclid-10-21@raw-af0f1d18e78120bb","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"78a801e3bebad653ea7b982b3e0543becf7676eff671c1e4c2057ff4e3b43b68","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.21/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.21\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-21:euclid-10-def-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-21","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-21.proof.1","euclid-10-21.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.21","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.21/","sourceLabel":"X. Def. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-21:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-21","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-21.proof.3","euclid-10-21.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.21","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.21/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1